# Regenerated by `next dev` on every run (Next.js agent-rules).
# The tick protocol now runs `next dev` for the 375px walk (D-103), so these
# would otherwise leave the tree dirty every tick and invite a junk commit.
# Cleaner fix if Dev ever wants it: `agentRules: false` in next.config.mjs.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

